sequenceDiagram
    actor Doctor
    participant Browser
    participant MVC as PrescriptionController
    participant RxSvc as PrescriptionService
    participant PdfSvc as PrescriptionPdfService
    participant UoW as UnitOfWork
    participant DB as SQL Server

    Doctor->>Browser: Open Prescription/Create(appointmentId)
    Browser->>MVC: GET Create
    MVC->>MVC: CanManageAppointmentAsync
    MVC->>RxSvc: GetCreateForm(appointmentId)
    RxSvc->>DB: SELECT Appointment Patient Doctor
    RxSvc-->>MVC: PrescriptionFormViewModel
    MVC-->>Browser: Prescription form

    Doctor->>Browser: Add medication items and notes
    Browser->>MVC: POST Create
    MVC->>MVC: Validate and filter empty items
    MVC->>RxSvc: CreatePrescription(model)
    RxSvc->>UoW: Add Prescription
    RxSvc->>UoW: Add PrescriptionItems
    UoW->>DB: INSERT Prescriptions PrescriptionItems
    DB-->>RxSvc: prescription Id
    RxSvc-->>MVC: success
    MVC-->>Browser: Redirect Details

    Doctor->>Browser: Open Prescription/Details
    Browser->>MVC: GET Details(appointmentId)
    MVC->>RxSvc: GetDetails(appointmentId)
    RxSvc->>DB: SELECT Prescription with Items
    RxSvc-->>MVC: PrescriptionDetailsViewModel
    MVC-->>Browser: Details view

    Doctor->>Browser: Click Download PDF
    Browser->>MVC: GET DownloadPdf(appointmentId)
    MVC->>PdfSvc: GeneratePdf(appointmentId)
    PdfSvc->>RxSvc: Load prescription data
    PdfSvc->>PdfSvc: Render QuestPDF document
    PdfSvc-->>MVC: byte array PDF
    MVC-->>Browser: FileResult application/pdf
    Browser-->>Doctor: Prescription PDF download
